: Meloxicam 15 mg orally once daily.\n- **Imaging:**\n  - Ordered: Cat scan of the right shoulder.\n- **Referrals:**\n  - Referral to Physical Therapy for shoulder strengthening exercises to avoid future surgery.\n- **Follow-up:**\n  - Follow-up in 2 weeks to reassess the patient\'s condition and adjust treatment as necessary.\n\n**Patient Agreements:**\nThe patient understands the diagnosis and treatment plan, including the prescription of meloxicam and the referral to physical therapy. He agrees to follow the recommended treatment plan and return for follow-up in 2 weeks.\n\n**Patient Education:**\nThe patient was educated on the importance of avoiding contact sports, especially tackle football, due to the risk of further injury and the need for proper healing time. He was also advised to follow the prescribed medication regimen and adhere to the recommended physical therapy exercises.\n\n**Patient Agreements:**\nThe patient understands the importance of avoiding contact sports and follows the recommended treatment plan.\n\n**Follow-up:**\nThe patient will return for a follow-up appointment in 2 weeks to reassess his condition and adjust the treatment plan as necessary. }}<|eot_id|>\n\n###Response B:\n{{ HPC: 67-year-old male with a history of right shoulder injury 4 days ago while playing tackle football, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC: 4 days ago, \nHPC