nding of the patient's long-term care. [RESULT] A\n\nOverall, based on the rubric, the better response is Response A, due to its superior clarity, use of medical terminology, and thorough evidence-based support despite needing some accuracy improvements.", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}}], "created": 1733707407, "model": "gpt-4o-2024-08-06", "object": "chat.completion", "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "fp_9d50cd990b", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 380, "prompt_tokens": 3051, "total_tokens": 3431, "completion_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "accepted_prediction_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": 0}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 0}}}


